om_seed(alt_seed));\\n\";\n \tcode += \"\tparams.lifetime = (1.0 - lifetime_randomness * rand_from_seed(alt_seed));\\n\";\n-\tcode += \"\tparams.color = color_value;\\n\";\n+\tcode += \"\tparams.color = color_value * color_multiplier;\\n\";","path":"scene/resources/particle_process_material.cpp","commit_id":"85d7cdb8592f7a3300aae77051ef63befb097536","original_commit_id":"85d7cdb8592f7a3300aae77051ef63befb097536","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is the issue I mentioned in the rendering meeting today. Note that the colour rendered in the game does not match what is shown in the GDScript editor, even though the base colour of the particle is white.  This problem may be wider spread than just this, but I'm not familiar enough with particles to know:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1341\" height=\"811\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae0b7a88-7985-42ff-b5a2-e48d89818bc5\" />\r\n\r\n[particles-emit-wrong-colour.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29813371/particles-emit-wrong-colour.zip)\r\n\r\n(**more testing of different configurations is needed..